`s 228(7) the provisions of this section apply to the variation as to the original contract` MEANS
    IF `the change is a variation of a director's service contract`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "to a variation of a director's service contract"

