    IF `the company has failed to comply with this section in relation to the contract`
    THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Failure to comply with this section in relation to a contract does not affect the validity of the contract"
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Failure to comply with this section in relation to a contract"

